From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Select original plain font polygons and share text raster setup
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Legacy checked polygon restrictions require MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_POLYGONS.
Original native glDraw2 retains all textured/untextured/float/scissor/utility
paths and original state-restoration/order decisions. Native matrix handles
remain the earlier ABI adaptation. Added text raster/quad helpers belong to
selected-source diagnostics; whole original gl.cpp and nlFont remain intact.

diff --git a/include/NL/FontTextState.h b/include/NL/FontTextState.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..efa67ac
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/NL/FontTextState.h
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+#ifndef NL_FONT_TEXT_STATE_H
+#define NL_FONT_TEXT_STATE_H
+#include "NL/gl/glState.h"
+
+// Original nlFont::DrawString plain/effect raster setup. Resource ownership,
+// page selection and clipped/split-effect drawing remain separate.
+inline void FontSetTextRasterState()
+{
+    glSetDefaultState(false);
+    glSetRasterState(GLS_AlphaBlend, 1);
+    glSetRasterState(GLS_AlphaTest, 1);
+    glSetRasterState(GLS_AlphaTestRef, 0);
+    glSetRasterState(GLS_Culling, 0);
+    glSetCurrentRasterState(glHandleizeRasterState());
+}
+#endif
